id=droiddeck-gpu-fix
name=DroidDeck GPU SELinux Fix
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=Muse
description=Grants the app domain read access to KGSL sysfs and SoC/vendor property contexts that the HyperOS port policy silently denies, so DroidDeck's GPU probe succeeds and Turnip is used instead of llvmpipe.
